(text "Simultaneous fan startup load-envelope experiment, NOT vendor model.\nDefault: assumed 1.1A/fan for 0.5s, then 0.55A/fan.\nAssumed 12V source, 0.5 ohm path, 100uF bus, 50mA auxiliary load.\nPlot V(fan_supply) and -I(Vsource). See startup_report.json." (at 25 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "747886bb-c81a-5021-bc2a-fbc61ad042ea"))
